<title>USA: Fulton Financial sets 10 pct dividend.</title>
<headline>Fulton Financial sets 10 pct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HERSHEY, Pa. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fulton Financial Corp said Thursday that it declared a ten percent stock dividend payable June 13 to shareholders of record on May 23.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid was a regular quarterly dividend of $0.17 per share on April 15.</p>
<p>Fulton Financial operates 117 banking offices in Pennsylvania, Maryland, Delaware and New Jersey.</p>
